---
const src = "https://cdn.hob.farm/articles/bblv/unlv-paluzzi-strip-detail-1982-v1.jpg";
---

<figure class="paluzzi article-wide not-prose" aria-labelledby="paluzzi-title">
  <figcaption>
    <strong id="paluzzi-title">What the 1982 panorama can actually establish</strong>
    <span>The labels identify visible landmarks, not a surveyed boundary for the future LINQ or Brooklyn Bowl.</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div>
    <img
      src={src}
      alt="Detail from Bob Paluzzi's December 1982 Las Vegas Strip panorama, showing wet Las Vegas Boulevard, Caesars Palace signs, and the Flamingo sign."
      width="1400"
      height="3174"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      data-lightbox={src}
      data-lightbox-caption="Detail from Bob Paluzzi's December 1982 Las Vegas Strip panorama. UNLV Special Collections and Archives, PH_00414_132-01."
    />
    <span class="pin pin--one"><b>1</b><i>Flamingo sign</i></span>
    <span class="pin pin--two"><b>2</b><i>Caesars Palace signs</i></span>
    <span class="pin pin--three"><b>3</b><i>Las Vegas Boulevard</i></span>
  </div>
  <p>
    Bob Paluzzi, December 8–9, 1982. UNLV Special Collections and Archives, Bob Paluzzi Panoramic Photographs, PH_00414_132-01. Copyright UNLV; educational use permitted. <a href="https://special.library.unlv.edu/ark:/62930/d1qb9z35k">Open the archive record</a>.
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .paluzzi {
    margin-block: 2.8rem !important;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.4rem);
    border-radius: 0.7rem;
    background: #0d1011;
    color: #eef1ef;
  }

  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  figcaption strong {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  figcaption span,
  p {
    color: #aeb7b4;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .paluzzi > div {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 27rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.13);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
  }

  .pin {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .pin b {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border: 2px solid white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #a83e31;
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.45);
    font: 800 0.66rem/1 var(--font-mono, monospace);
  }

  .pin i {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 0.2rem;
    background: rgb(8 10 10 / 0.86);
    color: white;
    font: normal 700 0.62rem/1.2 var(--font-mono, monospace);
  }

  .pin--one { top: 48%; right: -9%; }
  .pin--two { top: 56%; left: 13%; }
  .pin--three { top: 70%; left: 36%; }

  p {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0.9rem auto 0;
  }

  a {
    color: #70dccb;
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .pin i {
      display: none;
    }

    .pin--one { right: 3%; }
  }
</style>
